# messenger
===
 Free unofficial Facebook Messenger desktop client that fills the gap left by Meta's discontinued app. Tiny (just ~5 MB instead of 100-200 MB), fast, distraction-free. No feed, no reels, no marketplace. Just your conversations in a dedicated window. Built with ❤️ & Tauri for Windows, macOS and Linux.
